trong\">Janice</span>: Perhaps it's a paper jam somewhere. We ought to check. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: There could be a mechanical problem with the roller. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janice</span>: You might want to look at the control panel. Does it say anything? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, there is no error message. The network buttons are correct. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janice</span>: I'm not sure where the instruction manual is. If we open the top cover, we could see if anything is jammed. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Here is the lever.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le15ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "44000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janice</span>: Ah yes, I think that's it. I see a piece of paper that is jammed. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It would be a good idea to get the paper out.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janice</span>: I don't think we should pull it. The paper might tear and get stuck if you pull it. We may want to turn the roll of paper manually. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh look, there's the knob. If we turn the knob, we can advance the paper. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janice</span>:  OK, that's a good idea. There you go! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Success!  Thank you, Janice! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janice</span>: No problem!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le15ob01re2img01.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}